comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T15:37:28.401Z",codex-agent,"Additional evidence from pm-jev-vouf: a benchmark postprocessor assertion aborted after replacement inference but before report publication, losing one validated probability/latency per model. Both calls are counted in the real-label receipt; replacement persistence was moved before validation. This reinforces the existing need for append-only partial evaluation receipts rather than final-report-only publication."
body: ""
